Bluetooth␀␀␀Bluetooth needs no CAN wiring: this display connects over the Nordic UART Service the same way VESC Tool does - to a VESC Express, or straight to a BLE module on the controller's own UART.␀␀␀␀Controller␀␀Target VESC ID␀␀Second head␀Second head ID␀␀The dashboard polls the target; a second head only adds its temperatures. With it on, the dashboard treats a silent second head as a dead link - so leave it off unless there really are two controllers.␀␀␀CAN bus␀This display's CAN ID␀␀␀Bus speed (kbps)␀␀␀␀125
